// owner, is sealed in the Vault and is never returned.
//
// Sharing. The owner of a key (a user, or an organisation's owners) shares it with an organisation, a repository or a person. Agents
// and workflows of the grantee then use the key when they have none of their own at a more specific level: the resolution order of
