// `ListSharedWithMe` shows a label, the provider, whether the key works and, when the owner allows `see_spend`, what the grantee's
// own use cost this month. The owner sees the use of each sharer with `ShareUsage`. Sharing with a team is done by sharing with the
// repositories of the team. Only keys of a user or an organisation can be shared (an instance key already serves everyone, a
